Z||000000||theogre||11-05-2000||12:25 PM||||You asked for it you got it. <P>Awhile back Bill Osmer told you all about the lighted window switches he put in his car. A bunch of you wanted to know more. Bill's article on installing backlighted switches and GM's one touch down module are here. <A HREF="http://fierocave.shorturl.com" TARGET=_blank>The Fiero Cave</A> They are in the Make Me section under Options & Projects. Bill included a bunch of pictures and diagrams. If you have additional questions there is an Email link to Bill at the bottom of his page.<P>------------------<BR>Lake Superior? Is that what I stepped in? Sorry.||||reg||10
